  <AltText>
    Artfight attack featuring our youngest headmate, Kiyoi, from H.A.L. Zaldívar. Featured are Kiyoi and Carolina. Carolina belongs to H.A.L. Zaldívar. Kiyoi has light skin, black hair, and is wearing a big red sweater (looks cute on her actually), dark grey pants, and black shoes with heels. Carolina has brown skin, olive-green eyes, black hair, and is wearing a big blue sweater, very light green pants, and white shoes with pink trims. She is patting Kiyoi on the head, with the latter smiling with joy.
